	<row id="msg_0221_00050" index="50">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A candy that is packed with energy.\nIt raises the level of a single Pokémon\nby one.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00051" index="51">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It slightly raises the maximum PP of\na selected move that has been learned\nby the target Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00052" index="52">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A nutritious drink for Pokémon.\nIt raises the base Sp. Def (Special\nDefense) stat of a single Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00053" index="53">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It maximally raises the top PP of a\nselected move that has been learned\nby the target Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00054" index="54">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Old Chateau’s hidden specialty.\nIt heals all the status problems of a\nsingle Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00055" index="55">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item that prevents stat reduction\namong the Trainer’s party Pokémon\nfor five turns after use.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00056" index="56">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item that raises the critical-hit\nratio of a Pokémon in battle. It wears\noff if the Pokémon is withdrawn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00057" index="57">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item that raises the Attack stat\nof a Pokémon in battle. It wears off if\nthe Pokémon is withdrawn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00058" index="58">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item that raises the Defense stat\nof a Pokémon in battle. It wears off if\nthe Pokémon is withdrawn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00059" index="59">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item that raises the Speed stat\nof a Pokémon in battle. It wears off if\nthe Pokémon is withdrawn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00060" index="60">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item that raises the accuracy\nof a Pokémon in battle. It wears off if\nthe Pokémon is withdrawn.</language>
