		<language name="English">An item that prevents weak wild\nPokémon from appearing for 200 steps\nafter its use.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00077" index="77">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An item that prevents weak wild\nPokémon from appearing for 250 steps\nafter its use.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00078" index="78">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A long, durable rope.\nUse it to escape instantly from a cave\nor a dungeon.</language>
