	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00086" index="86">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A small and rare mushroom.\nIt is quite popular among certain\nmaniacal fan segments.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00087" index="87">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A large and rare mushroom.\nIt is very popular among certain\nmaniacal fan segments.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00088" index="88">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A somewhat-small pearl that sparkles\nin a pretty silver color.\nIt can be sold cheaply to shops.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00089" index="89">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A quite-large pearl that sparkles in a\npretty silver color. It can be sold at\na high price to shops.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00090" index="90">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lovely, red-colored sand with a loose,\nsilky feel. It can be sold at a high\nprice to shops.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00091" index="91">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A shard of a pretty gem that sparkles\nin a red color. It can be sold at a\nhigh price to shops.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00092" index="92">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A nugget of pure gold that gives off a\nlustrous gleam. It can be sold at a\nhigh price to shops.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00093" index="93">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A pretty, heart-shaped scale that is\nextremely rare. It glows faintly in the\ncolors of the rainbow.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00094" index="94">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A sweet honey with a lush aroma that\nattracts wild Pokémon when it is used\nin grass, caves, or on special trees.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00095" index="95">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A fertilizer to be spread on soft soil.\nIt speeds up the growth of Berries.\nHowever, it also dries the soil faster.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00096" index="96">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A fertilizer to be spread on soft soil.\nIt slows the growth of Berries and\ncauses the soil to dry slower.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00097" index="97">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A fertilizer to be spread on soft soil.\nIt extends the time ripened Berries\nremain on their plants before falling.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00098" index="98">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A fertilizer to be spread on soft soil.\nIt ups the number of times new plants\ngrow where mature plants withered.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00099" index="99">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A fossil of an ancient Pokémon that\nlived in the sea. It appears to be\npart of a plant root.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00100" index="100">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A fossil of an ancient Pokémon that\nlived in the sea. It appears to be\npart of a claw.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00101" index="101">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A fossil of an ancient Pokémon that\nlived in the sea. It appears to be\npart of a seashell.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00102" index="102">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A fossil of an ancient Pokémon that\nlived in the sea. It appears to be\npart of a shell.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00103" index="103">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
