		<language name="English">A mystical, rainbow feather\nthat sparkles.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00484" index="484">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A mysterious Egg obtained from Mr.\nPokémon. What’s in the Egg is unknown.</language>
	</row>
