		<language name="English">A special Poké Ball for the Pal Park.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00501" index="501">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A nice photo album for storing all the\nphotos taken along your adventure.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00502" index="502">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A music player that allows you to listen\nto nostalgic songs. It’s operated with\na single switch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00503" index="503">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An old-fashioned bell with a gentle,\nsoothing sound.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00504" index="504">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A famous candy in Mahogany Town. Many\ntourists like to buy them to take home.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00505" index="505">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It holds Pokéathlon records. It’s a\ncard that shows how many victories\nyou’ve had.</language>
	</row>
