	<row id="msg_0221_00534" index="534">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A shiny red orb that is said to have\na legend and has a deep connection with\nthe Hoenn region.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00535" index="535">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A shiny blue orb that is said to have\na legend and has a deep connection with\nthe Hoenn region.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00536" index="536">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A crystal ball that was excavated from\nthe ground. A very beautiful stone that\nis covered with bits of rock and earth.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00537" index="537">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A peculiar black\nstone that makes\ncertain Pokémon\nevolve.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00538" index="538">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A block of peat\nthat makes certain\nPokémon evolve\nunder a full moon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00539" index="539">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A sour apple that\nmakes certain\nPokémon evolve.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00540" index="540">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A sweet apple that\nmakes certain\nPokémon evolve.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00541" index="541">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A syrupy apple\nthat makes certain\nPokémon evolve.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00542" index="542">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A mysterious lump.\nRaises the Defense\nand Sp. Def of a\nPokémon that can\nstill evolve.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00543" index="543">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A scale that\nshines a rainbow\ncolour. Certain\nPokémon evolve\nwhen holding it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00544" index="544">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A peculiar stone\nthat can make\ncertain species of\nPokémon evolve.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00545" index="545">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A cord that links\ntwo Pokémon. Makes\ncertain Pokémon\nevolve.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0221_00546" index="546">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
